{"name": "OPERATIVES: Revolve", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"346\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/7138318d52cc9deddb510d717d5b2dfa.poster.avif?t=1787901635\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/7138318d52cc9deddb510d717d5b2dfa.webm?t=1787901635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/7138318d52cc9deddb510d717d5b2dfa.mp4?t=1787901635\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u201cOPERATIVES: Revolve\u201d</strong> is a cinematic roguelike deckbuilder with multiple unique gameplay mechanics. Play as <strong>Operatives</strong>, secret agents chosen to enforce the will of the <strong>Machine Doctrine</strong>. In this world, humanity didn\u2019t invent technology; it was <i>placed into our hands</i> when the Doctrine descended in our most primitive age, <strong>propelling</strong>\u00a0<strong>civilization forward and sowing the chaos that followed</strong>. Wield Machine cards to strike and block in physical combat, hunt down those who resist your directive, and uncover the hidden truths behind this machinated world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"347\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/361d58961f853959d6d0efcd29bdc65f.avif?t=1787901635\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each card can be upgraded by installing unique <strong>Chassis\u00a0</strong>and <strong>Wheel</strong> components. Each component boasts its own distinct design and effects. Utilize them to optimize your cards and experiment with different gameplay strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"150\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/4ce7af2700cc6dc0b27714bc00352c46.poster.avif?t=1787901635\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/4ce7af2700cc6dc0b27714bc00352c46.webm?t=1787901635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Destructible Cards</strong> - Cards have a unique health system, indicated by their Wheel. They can be destroyed in combat, adding a unique strategic layer to how you manage your cards. <br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"250\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/c3811c02cd32138f66629cec067ab2d9.avif?t=1787901635\" width=\"616\"/></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Toolkits and Artifacts</strong>- Powerful resources that further improve your component-card combos or create new gameplay strategies. These toolkits can be swapped out at any time to adjust your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/9ce59edf9e8b875dd23452f376cc8bbc.poster.avif?t=1787901635\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/9ce59edf9e8b875dd23452f376cc8bbc.webm?t=1787901635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/9ce59edf9e8b875dd23452f376cc8bbc.mp4?t=1787901635\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"201\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/f8b5f63633deddaafb509f80130068b0.avif?t=1787901635\" width=\"616\"/></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Intense Visual and Combat</strong> -\u00a0Featuring combat with visual that can reshape how each fight plays. <br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/03c9b3c78db814ae82358d3df894ff33.poster.avif?t=1787901635\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/03c9b3c78db814ae82358d3df894ff33.webm?t=1787901635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/03c9b3c78db814ae82358d3df894ff33.mp4?t=1787901635\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Chain Mechanics</strong> - Feature complex, multi-synergy to chain your strategies into powerful combos with intense visual feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"318\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/843e7d2c6eba7ed5dc0265f358e886fd.poster.avif?t=1787901635\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/843e7d2c6eba7ed5dc0265f358e886fd.webm?t=1787901635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/843e7d2c6eba7ed5dc0265f358e886fd.mp4?t=1787901635\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"324\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/84e0b935d40ffca5043532a20e8ebc7e.poster.avif?t=1787901635\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/84e0b935d40ffca5043532a20e8ebc7e.webm?t=1787901635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/84e0b935d40ffca5043532a20e8ebc7e.mp4?t=1787901635\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Evolving Challenge</strong> - Enemies come in varied forms and employ dynamic attack strategies. Enemy behaviors can be rolled and remixed each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Replayability</strong> - Each run is different. Select 2 out of 5 Operatives to battle against enemies with evolving behaviors, experiencing a myriad of interactions with the Operatives, world building, and story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Multi-Directional</strong> - Card placement is key to your strategy, enemies will attack from different directions.   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Combination Deck</strong> - Each Operative has their own set of unique cards, designed to synergize differently when paired with a different Operative.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Optimization</strong> - This game is optimized to run smoothly on older devices. We aim to launch with <strong>Steam Deck Verified</strong> support. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"347\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/b405a397512beeaeaa6e86c030503426.avif?t=1787901635\" width=\"616\"/></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"132\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/a1e2439a8aa77d3cd9ee460418300d47.avif?t=1787901635\" width=\"616\"/></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "A roguelike deckbuilder with cards you can almost touch. Every card is both cover and weapon, discarded the moment it is used. In your hand, they block bullets, blades and death itself. Discover a unique deckbuilder built on deep, interacting mechanics.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/045307b38e85dc76c42f1fa3a7c21f6fd808dc63/header.jpg?t=1787901635", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Roguelike Deckbuilder", "Deckbuilding", "Card Game", "Mechs", "Card Battler", "Strategy"], "developers": "Enigma Equation", "publishers": "Enigma Equation", "release_date": "2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3004810", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "9 February 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/r7Wqp_uLiS8", "first_seen": 1770591600.0, "review_rank": 1237}